CIUTREyGYkSGWF4FJXD1jWXuEBr2670xfbTtuYD3ZVMdZSR0VW3AUyQXq7DY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvAhdM9ecDdqWr5mA1hmMwQ9hYqXekYKnMD8Zc4omii-A&oe=69A6BF47"}, {"file_name": "Crossbow_ScreenShot.png", "id": "2397984983893950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391978_2397984990560616_3969625957978599437_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OnF63CjAHL4Q7kNvwGJcAEi&_nc_oc=Adk9GISTGWNzFQvd5Uou66jdFOzYxAtPab9A5sp5tgkU00lNL-C1X6L4LQwNmmU6lGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afus5BU4YEgkxRTWeuwSHZbNqnOjny2wBngGE-6YePCoGg&oe=69A6C4ED"}, {"file_name": "Olympic_ScreenShot.png", "id": "648582874300164", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392305_648582880966830_2648986520125630881_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nhrZzR2HVfAQ7kNvwHEZ4lX&_nc_oc=AdkfpBP2jdb1YzXSnyIQfiCWVssW_X1x515-v13rkothdf0xJO0VM-QxEYIgLRu0-ZE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvcwvjnc6ohvd7EXFDPdyEZqfzfX7dKlZoz-8VO9XeCYA&oe=69A6C3E1"}, {"file_name": "BallonPop_Screenshot.png", "id": "2053609291789381", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391967_2053609295122714_5342321999149614343_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pYJtfnkjiLAQ7kNvwH4o3Yj&_nc_oc=Adk-yA-kcUB9GsUe4XNN27zGvDGhATXhBENYOdctCDYf8e_rt3zbiVe6e4Smd7c7TsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftAKbLYTdD7pdr7Diea9nmp0h1UlGdsl4XArlNwZVLoZw&oe=69A6D6B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLogo_Landscape.png", "id": "616531301220959", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391901_616531307887625_1642505082054004162_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x3eM95WQnaQQ7kNvwFmpIot&_nc_oc=AdmNpvVpNACYXJTFN9np_dm75iI1meAJtXMKw2XoegPNwfgKtlaDCm84a6OSrLNCNUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuz2csQWwzVvP9jVJLMUo2dwKZq_BWIlgvquzrbsISZGQ&oe=69A6D783"}, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "short_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/varcher-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meatspace Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id"